 "One light-year = 299,792 km/s × 3.156 × 10⁷ s ≈ 9.46 × 10¹² km. Proxima: 4.24 × 9.46 × 10¹² ≈ 4.0 × 10¹³ km. A message there and a reply back would take at least 8.5 years.",
